Grandet public catalogue hub — license scope

The original catalogue tool and browser code in scripts/, tests/, app.mjs,
index.html and style.css, and Grandet-authored project documentation and
contribution templates listed in public-export-manifest.json, are licensed
under the GNU Affero General Public License version 3 only
(SPDX: AGPL-3.0-only). The complete license text is in
LICENSES/AGPL-3.0-only.txt.

This independent hub contains no desktop client, SDK, or gateway distribution.
The separately scoped price-finder plugin in plugins/grandet-api-price-finder/
and its .claude-plugin/marketplace.json and .agents/plugins/marketplace.json
descriptors use Apache-2.0; see the plugin LICENSE and package-manifest.json.
This exception covers only those selected files. Existing hub files retain
their listed rights. public-export-manifest.json enumerates the actual files
and their individual rights categories.

The software license does not cover data/free-tokens.json or data/free-tokens-v3.json, the factual
catalogues CATALOGUE.md and CATALOGUE-v3.md, source evidence references, vendor statements, or
trademarks. DATA-LICENSE.md and data/MANIFEST.json define the data boundary;
TRADEMARKS.md defines the Grandet name boundary. No supplier rights are
sublicensed by this software license. The data manifest records the public
factual compilation scope and respective source ownership.
